    "sentence_translations": [
      "(7) See You Tomorrow",
      "",
      "Little Tian and Lele chatted online for a very long time.",
      "",
      "“Little Tian, will you still come tomorrow?” Lele asked.",
      "",
      "“Yes. After chatting with you, I don’t feel so tired anymore,” Little Tian said.",
      "",
      "“Are you very tired?” Lele asked.",
      "",
      "“After Mom passed away, I felt very tired every day.”",
      "",
      "“I understand. Missing someone too much can make you feel tired.”",
      "",
      "“See you tomorrow, Lele.”",
      "",
      "“See you tomorrow, Little Tian.”",
      "",
      "On the third day, Little Tian came to the internet cafe. Lele was waiting for him.",
      "The two of them chatted for two hours. They were very happy.",
      "",
      "On the fourth day, Little Tian came to the internet cafe. Lele was also waiting for him.",
      "The two of them chatted for three hours. They were very happy.",
      "",
      "On the fifth day, Little Tian came to the internet cafe. Lele was also waiting for him.",
      "The two of them chatted for the entire evening. They still had a lot to say.",
      ""
